## Overview

IntelliStream is a distributed real-time event processing platform that monitors animal health telemetry data and predicts risk levels using Machine Learning.

## Features

* Real-time event streaming using Kafka
* Producer-Consumer architecture
* Machine Learning based risk prediction
* PostgreSQL database integration
* FastAPI REST APIs
* Streamlit analytics dashboard
* Docker containerization
* Cloud deployment on Render

## Tech Stack

* Python
* FastAPI
* Kafka
* PostgreSQL
* Redis
* Docker
* Streamlit
* Render
* Machine Learning
